\page vendors The Draco Vendors

\par  Authors
<a href="mailto:kgt@lanl.gov">Kelly Thompson</a>,
<a href="mailto:jhchang@lanl.gov">Jae Chang</a>

\par Executive Summary

Some Draco packages use third party libraries. This page provides some information about these third
parties and how to obtain or build them.

\par Introduction

The vendors used by Draco and associated projects are maintained by the Draco core team and are
typically build using the spack package manager (https://github.com/spack/spack). Vendor software is
typically built per platform (CCSNET, ATS-3, ATS-4, etc.) and stored in either the
`/ccs/codes/radtran/vendors` or `/usr/projects/draco/vendors` directories.  On LANL HPC systems,
Draco uses a modified version of the LAP SE installation.  Access to pre-installed vendor tools is
accessed through the module system through a command similar to `module load lapse/3.01-gnu`.

Draco uses the compilers and MPI files provided by the systems team for each platform. Each MPI
installation requires a custom installation to correctly use the high speed interconnect hardware.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

* See http://www.mcternan.me.uk/mscgen/ for mscgen command syntax

\msc
# Draco versions
d521, d600, d610, d620, d720;

# Gap before boxes
|||;

# Versions of draco on the same line
d521 rbox d521 [label="Draco-5_21_0", textbgcolour="#ff7f7f"],
d600 rbox d600 [label="Draco-6_0_0", textbgcolour="#ff7f7f"],
d610 rbox d610 [label="Draco-6_1_0", textbgcolour="#ff7f7f"],
d620 rbox d620 [label="Draco-6_2_0", textbgcolour="#ff7f7f"],
d720 rbox d720 [label="Draco-7_20_0", textbgcolour="#7fff7f"];

# Vendor association with version

# OpenMPI
d521 abox d521 [label="OpenMPI-1.3.3", textbgcolour="#ff7f7f"];
d600 abox d620 [label="OpenMPI-1.4.3", textbgcolour="#ff7f7f"];
d720 abox d720 [label="openmpi@5:", textbgcolour="#7fff7f"];

# GNU Scientific Library (GSL)
d521 abox d620 [label="gsl@1.14:", textbgcolour="#ff7f7f"];
d720 abox d720 [label="gsl@2.8:", textbgcolour="#7fff7f"];

# Others
d720 abox d720 [label="cmake@3.30:", textbgcolour="#7fff7f"];
d720 abox d720 [label="random123@1.14::", textbgcolour="#7fff7f"];
d720 abox d720 [label="eospac@6.5:", textbgcolour="#7fff7f"];
d720 abox d720 [label="metis@5.1:", textbgcolour="#7fff7f"];
d720 abox d720 [label="openblas@0.3.30:", textbgcolour="#7fff7f"];

\endmsc

*/
